1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,067
Hi, I’m Zippy.

2
00:00:02,067 --> 00:00:03,067
Here’s FIRSTgo,

3
00:00:03,067 --> 00:00:04,033
from the first

4
00:00:04,033 --> 00:00:05,467
scan to disbursal.

5
00:00:06,167 --> 00:00:07,333
Enter your registered

6
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:08,800
dealer mobile,

7
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,300
and tap Get OTP.

8
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:12,900
Type the six-digit OTP.

9
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:13,300
You’re

10
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,600
in at the last digit.

11
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:15,900
And you’re in,

12
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,100
on your dealer home.

13
00:00:17,933 --> 00:00:18,867
Point the scanner

14
00:00:18,867 --> 00:00:19,333
at it,

15
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:20,567
and FIRSTgo reads

16
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:21,500
the offer.

17
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,933
There it is:

18
00:00:22,933 --> 00:00:24,167
their pre-approved offer,

19
00:00:24,167 --> 00:00:25,633
