34
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,667
Liveness passes,

35
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:49,600
Aadhaar e-KYC is fetched,

36
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,533
and FIRSTgo moves

37
00:00:50,533 --> 00:00:51,933
on by itself.

38
00:00:54,133 --> 00:00:55,167
Show your customer

39
00:00:55,167 --> 00:00:57,733
