67
00:01:36,467 --> 00:01:37,467
month by month.

68
00:01:38,267 --> 00:01:40,033
Your latest payouts are

69
00:01:40,033 --> 00:01:41,533
on the home screen.

70
00:01:41,533 --> 00:01:43,300
Tap a UTR

71
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:44,300
to copy it.

72
00:01:44,633 --> 00:01:45,800
In Payouts,

73
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,033
