74
00:01:47,033 --> 00:01:48,233
in one tap.

75
00:01:50,633 --> 00:01:52,267
TA and INF shows

76
00:01:52,267 --> 00:01:53,133
your Trade Advance

77
00:01:53,133 --> 00:01:55,067
and Inventory Funding limits.

78
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:57,367
Check what’s utilised,

79
00:01:57,367 --> 00:01:57,733
and the dues

80
00:01:57,733 --> 00:01:58,667
coming up.

81
00:01:59,567 --> 00:02:00,967
Portfolio shows every

82
00:02:00,967 --> 00:02:02,133
loan you sourced,

83
00:02:02,133 --> 00:02:03,433
by DPD bucket.

84
00:02:03,933 --> 00:02:05,767
RC pendency lists every

85
00:02:05,767 --> 00:02:07,400
RC still due.

86
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,033
Tick and update together.

87
00:02:09,767 --> 00:02:10,967
Tap me any time

88
00:02:10,967 --> 00:02:11,333
